      "description": "AHOST is the City of Austin’s searchable map and listing of income‑restricted affordable rental housing. Case workers and clients can enter household income and size to identify properties that may be affordable, then contact properties directly about availability and waitlists. The portal also links to renter resources, including financial assistance for rent and utilities and help with landlord issues.",
