      "name": "Ending Community Homelessness Coalition (ECHO) – Coordinated Entry & Youth Housing Referrals",
      "description": "ECHO manages the regional homelessness response system and Coordinated Entry for Austin/Travis County. Young adults exiting foster care who are experiencing or at risk of homelessness can be assessed and referred to youth‑focused rapid rehousing, transitional housing, and permanent supportive housing programs (including LifeWorks and other providers). ECHO also provides data and navigation support to connect clients with available housing resources.",
