      "description": "PAL and related DFPS aftercare services support youth aging out of foster care with housing assistance, stipends, and case management. Eligible young adults may access transitional living funds, supervised independent living, and other supports that can be combined with local housing resources in Austin. Coordination with the youth’s PAL worker can help secure deposits, basic furnishings, and short‑term financial support.",
